Added a `table` layout to `ObjectListWidget`, with `columns`, `cells`, `itemTitle` and `maxItems`, where each item is edited in a dialog that writes back only on Save and has a menu with Move up, Move down, Duplicate and a confirmed Remove. Added `fixedItems`, which hides Add, Duplicate and Remove so that the items of a list cannot be added or removed. Nested validation of `object` and `object_list` fields now runs on submit and opens the first item with errors (fixes #7077). Added `validateItem` and `itemIds: false`, and schema functions now receive `intl`. The fields of a `ModalForm` dialog now have namespaced ids, so their labels no longer collide with page fields of the same name; add-on tests that select these fields by id need to use the `modal-` prefix. Based on the work in #7078 and #7169. @alexandreIFB
